# gadget_damage (bsrl-sim issue #55 follow-up, a diff on top of desc_audit.patch): gadgets that ran without the damage
# their data or text names. fire 3's super_dist sets where a thrown gadget lands (gadget.c aimed_range: Griff's coins);
# a SKILL AREA with AreaEffectFollowType 1 sits at the brawler (8-Bit); ITEM passes the main attack's Damage x
# CustomValue1 % to the item (Belle's trap); Gale's WindWall is masked (no push rule in this libg).
# Check: python -m super_audit --gadget, python -m super_audit --gadget --gadget-slot 1, python -m gadget_check
